<h2 class="wp-block-heading">The Christmas Table Map: What Goes Where</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Every holiday table has four jobs: something pretty in the middle, space for each guest, warm light and room for the food. When each job has its own zone, even a small table looks generous instead of crowded, and every idea below fits into one of these zones.</p>



