<p class="wp-block-paragraph">On the left, a tall bouquet blocks the view, and tinsel, boxes and figures leave no room for plates. On the right, the same small round table has a low centerpiece, flameless candles and four calm place settings, with space left for the food. For a matching look in the rest of the room, see our <a href="https://dailyspacehacks.com/christmas-mantel-decorating-ideas/">Christmas mantel decorating ideas</a> and the Christmas looks in our <a href="https://dailyspacehacks.com/coffee-table-decor/">coffee table decor</a> guide.</p>



